  "details": "After the release of our new ui menu (yes has being a pretty long time), the entire avatar/world/profile doesn't update.\n\nWhen uploading a new avatar I am FORCED to restart the game to see my new avatar. This includes upload & test builds.\n\nThis is the same for worlds and also for your profile (where worlds/avatars) can be found.\n\nThere is NO refresh button and no way to update unless restarting the game.\n\nI am expecting when I open a menu it has the most up to date information.\n\nI don't expect it to live update so long i keep the menu open but at least refresh when I come in one of these tabs.\n\nUploading/testing avatar and worlds is just a nightmare if you don't override a existing uploaded avatar/world.",
